    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "intention, aim, purpose, design",
      "explanation": "A deliberate intention or purpose behind an action or plan. Implies conscious, calculated planning rather than a vague wish. Can carry a nuance of hidden or underlying motive."
